 "remarks": "A rare and unique property with separate legal cottage (accessory apartment) located in the historic and convenient area of Tracey school. This charming home was an original stable and includes stone fireplace and open floor plan. The detached renovated cottage can be used as an apartment, getaway, studio or office. The home is situated on a level parklike .27 acre with mature trees and privacy. The main house includes a first and second floor with 2 bedrooms, 1 full bath, Living room/fireplace, den, and Kitchen. The cottage is a renovated studio with bath and kitchen.  Both the main house and cottage have separate utilities but shared water. Main house is 1135 sf and cottage is 336 sf. Add your special touch and TLC to make this a warm New England home!",
